Name:P3b - the real g021 turn-50 board, with the lifelink blocker (control)
Description:The board as it was: Moldering Karok (lifelink) blocks, and the crocodile side has black mana for Stonefare Crocodile's lifelink. The best blocks let 10 through, but the Karok's lifelink gains 3 at the same time, so the opponent survives at 3 or more. The audit's detector called this a missed lethal; it was not. alpha-strike-count must not fire. Round 1018: with the rules off, Forge's heuristic attacks here and takes the crocodiles to 3-6 (off); at max Flat Monte Carlo overrides that with no attack on one rollout per candidate (1667 vs 1380), which is what really stalled g021 for 20 turns. Not lethal, so alpha-strike-count must stay out.
Turns:1
